+# TorVPN — obfs4 example profile
+# =============================================================================
+# Use this profile if you're on a network that blocks/throttles Tor. Drop it
+# at %ProgramData%\torvpn\profile.toml and edit the [tor] section to point at
+# a real obfs4 bridge + obfs4proxy.exe binary.
